      ],
      "text": "Ante offers four run modes: interactive TUI (`ante`), headless one-shot (`ante -p`), server daemon (`ante serve`) over a JSONL protocol, and gateway mode for Slack/Discord bots."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a2bf168f136c18ae234133ddd641f8a7376615fbb77658a99eebfb3424ac96f8",
