        "slc_b6703eb9b2af58d5889e0c79fd96cf76bfa1ae2b5fa24b2330e9d754b8483082"
      ],
      "text": "The curated `pi` profile reduces Ante to four tools (Read, Write, Edit, Bash) plus a short replacement system prompt, with file search via `rg`, subagents via `ante -p`, and web access via `curl`."
    },
