      "text": "Ante ships 17 maintained provider presets (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Open Router, local GGUF, and others) and supports custom endpoints via a `~/.ante/catalog.json` config with wire_style, auth style, headers, and extra_body."
    },
