      ],
      "text": "Ante is evaluated continuously on Terminal-Bench 2.1 under official leaderboard constraints (89 tasks, 5 trials each); the latest reported full run scored 82.7% with DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731, with raw Harbor runs linked for audit."
    },
